  "body": "## Summary\n- add noncanonical, receipt-backed intake runs with 2/2/2 cohort ceilings\n- separate scout packets, audit-only decisions, and deterministic promotion across protected-branch transitions\n- bind decisions to collision-safe canonical packet manifests and reject symlinks, non-HTTP sources, placeholders, duplicate prose/visuals, low-information images, invalid source IDs, and rename admissions\n- add fail-closed cron wrappers, CI/pre-push gates, CODEOWNERS, and operational documentation\n- enforce canonical OKF schema before audit and rollback failed promotion\n\n## Verification\n- focused intake/provenance/fail-closed suite: 25 passed, 1 conditional fixture skipped\n- visual validator suite: 5 passed\n- hook self-test: green\n- full corpus: 2,605 OKF files clean; generated index fresh\n- synthetic three-commit drill: ready packet -&gt; audit-only approval -&gt; deterministic promotion\n- synthetic promoted corpus: 2,617 OKF files clean; diff-aware intake gate clean\n- pre-push gate: green\n\n## Security regressions covered\n- canonical visual schema mismatch\n- symlink omission from validation and hashes\n- Git rename admission bypass\n- arbitrary Claim source values\n- publisher-controlled subdomain false independence\n- NUL-framing packet hash collision\n- non-HTTP receipt/discovery protocols\n- same-PR self-approval\n\n## Operational state\nBathcat and Mennonite recurring jobs remain paused. This PR does not resume them.\n\n## Review-key posture (resolved)\nThis is a single-account repository, and GitHub forbids approving your own pull request, so a required approving review can never be satisfied here \u2014 enabling one with enforced admins would deadlock every PR, including this one. Zero required approving reviews is therefore the deliberate configuration, not a discrepancy. `main` keeps the strict `validate` check, resolved conversations, enforced admins, and force-push/deletion blocks. CODEOWNERS documents ownership only; the human key is T's authenticated account merging each PR behind green CI. The docs in this PR state this law explicitly.",
